  "details": "Repro world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_cb0f8c4b-8e92-431d-bd12-ea2243d31413\nStep to repro:\n1.Place VRCChair3 and unpack prefab\n2.Create new Animator Controller and create bool parameter named \"InStation\"\n3.Set the Animator Controller to GameObject VRCChair3 -> Component VRC_Station -> Animator Controller\n4.Sit onto the station using SDK3 avatar\n-> Stuck\nSDK2 Avatars can survive this but if once stuck with SDK3 avatar, only way to recover is rejoin to the world. This has happened in a recent update, but the exact version is unknown.",
